# Project instructions

Before starting a task, read this file. Use `Scratchpad` to state the task, plan, and progress. Replace completed task notes when a new task starts. Record reusable project facts and corrections in `Lessons`.

## Scratchpad

Task: promote all seven appendix L rules explicitly approved by the user, correct section numbering, and capture first-version confirmation and organizational follow-up.

Plan:
- [x] Read user approval and compare it with the five current subsection headings and seven logical rules.
- [x] Rewrite appendix L as seven approved, separately numbered requirements.
- [x] Promote decisions and update architecture/plan; keep internal appointments and regulations open.
